###

### Settings — Update company profile
PATCH http://localhost:4000/settings/company
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJjbXE0b3V0OHAwMDAxYWtuc3k2MGtubmZkIiwiY29tcGFueUlkIjoiY21xNG91dDA4MDAwMGFrbnNvaWN1ejVrcCIsInJvbGUiOiJBRE1JTiIsImlhdCI6MTc4MDk0NTQ5OCwiZXhwIjoxNzgwOTQ2Mzk4fQ.cxbgF7P8ttO6Wc4NEifJ-RBQCnsP1SGoaUNCh7BdpvI

{
  "name": "Muster Handwerk GmbH",
  "address": "Musterstraße 1, 10115 Berlin",
  "vatId": "DE123456789",
  "defaultVatRate": 19,
  "paymentTermsDays": 14,
